<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - News Corp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - News Corp.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities said analyst John Tinker downgraded News Corp Ltd to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 21-1/2 Tuesday in U.S. trading.</p>
